d off in chains, living in a country that wasn't theirs."}, "tmp_jer/c10.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "For", "start": 0.0, "end": 1.04}, {"text": "I", "start": 1.04, "end": 1.44}, {"text": "know", "start": 1.44, "end": 1.86}, {"text": "the", "start": 1.86, "end": 2.32}, {"text": "thoughts", "start": 2.32, "end": 2.9}, {"text": "that", "start": 2.9, "end": 3.38}, {"text": "I", "start": 3.38, "end": 3.78}, {"text": "think", "start": 3.78, "end": 4.28}, {"text": "toward", "start": 4.28, "end": 4.76}, {"text": "you,", "start": 4.76, "end": 5.7}, {"text": "sayeth", "start": 5.76, "end": 6.44}, {"text": "the", "start": 6.44, "end": 6.64}, {"text": "Lord.", "start": 6.64, "end": 6.96}], "text": "For I know the thoughts that I think toward you, sayeth the Lord."}, "tmp_jer/c11.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "Jeremiah", "start": 0.0, "end": 1.02}, {"text": "29", "start": 1.02, "end": 1.8}, {"text": "verse", "start": 1.8, "end": 2.66}, {"text": "11", "start": 2.66, "end": 3.3}], "text": "Jeremiah 29 verse 11"}, "tmp_jer/c12.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "Read", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.68}, {"text": "the", "start": 0.68, "end": 0.88}, {"text": "verse", "start": 0.88, "end": 1.04}, {"text": "before", "start": 1.04, "end": 1.4}, {"text": "it.", "start": 1.4, "end": 1.64}, {"text": "He", "start": 2.06, "end": 2.16}, {"text": "tells", "start": 2.16, "end": 2.58}, {"text": "them", "start": 2.58, "end": 2.82}, {"text": "they'll", "start": 2.82, "end": 3.14}, {"text": "be", "start": 3.14, "end": 3.34}, {"text": "there", "start": 3.34, "end": 3.7}, {"text": "70", "start": 3.7, "end": 4.6}, {"text": "years.", "start": 4.6, "end": 5.5}], "text": "Read the verse before it. He tells them they'll be there 70 years."}, "tmp_jer/c13.mp3": {"words": [{"text": "Seventy", "start": 0.0, "end": 1.0}, {"text": "years.", "start": 1.0, "end": 1.44}, {"text": "Most", "start": 2.7, "end": 3.08}, {"text": "of", "start": 3.08, "end": 3.26}, {"text": "those", "start": 3.26, "end": 3.46}, {"text": "people", "start": 3